# Q: are the frames and the ephemeris telling the same story?
#
# A probe about scale rather than about flying. Every body's distance from the Sun, every
# orbital speed, and the ratio between them are one order of magnitude check away from
# catching a unit error anywhere in the solar frame.

body mercury
body venus
body earth
body mars
body jupiter
body saturn
body uranus
body neptune
body moon

expect "Mercury is inside 0.5 AU" range 0.5 less
advance 1
body earth
expect "the Earth is about an AU out" range 1.05 less
